-- 1296_senate_2026_deep_seed.sql
-- 2026 U.S. Senate deep seed: 31 new general/primary race sets + ME/MA existing-race fixes.
-- Research: 6 agent groups 2026-07-09/10 (BP via api.php + state SOS oracles + official results);
-- ballot-qualification VERIFICATION PASS on all 40 BP-only third-party/independent names
-- (state SOS records; evidence in scratchpad wsen/verify_group[123].json + master board).
