-- names are NOT seeded (dated re-checks in .planning/todos/2026-07-10-senate-seed-recheck-calendar.md).
-- pid reuse per wsen/pid_map_decisions.md (placeholder-pid preference; 4 rejected homonyms).
-- New politicians: external_id band -(66000000+seq); is_incumbent=false EXPLICIT (column default is true).
